# REFERENCE SOLUTION (w6d1 challenge C). Allow-list: exclude everything, then re-include only what
# the image needs. New directories (next month's experiments/, a new dataset) stay out by default.
*
!requirements.txt
!src
!models
# ...but never bytecode caches inside the re-included directories (patterns are root-anchored,
# so **/ is needed to reach src/flowguard/__pycache__).
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
